    "description": "The Aga Khan University-Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED) conferred its second Advanced Diplomas to teachers and heads from various government and private schools on Saturday, July 31, 1999 at the AKU auditorium. The Chief Guest was Captain U. A. G. Isani, Chairman, and University Grants Commission of Pakistan.",
